<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Frost for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 4</h3>The <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=883/bloodmages-regalia">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Bloodmage's Regalia</span></a> is the best tier set we've seen this expansion, using at least 4 piece will your best in slot by the end of this phase, and you can even use 5-piece as best in slot with alternative off-pieces. These are the starting points for the tier 10 which you then upgrade using tokens from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a>. Aim to get the bonuses of this set as soon as possible.<br/>
<br/>The <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49908/primordial-saronite">
