<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 4</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 4</h3>If you're a fresh level 80, you can farm the 245 ilvl tier 9 (<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47771/sunstriders-hood-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_102.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Hood of Triumph</span></a>) through heroic gamma dungeons, since you can purchase <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47242/trophy-of-the-crusade">
