<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="wrist">Wrist for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 4</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50651/the-ladys-brittle-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_44.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Lady's Brittle Bracers</span></a> are best in slot, and a big chunk of the total required hit for arcane that you'll use. In the case that you took up another hit item on another slot and plan on sticking with it, then the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50686/death-surgeons-sleeves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_47.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death Surgeon's Sleeves</span></a> are a good option.<br/>
<br/>From 10-Man <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a>, there's the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51872/ether-soaked-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_44.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ether-Soaked Bracers</span></a> which in same overall best in slot set, alongside two <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40153/veiled-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Veiled Ametrine</span></a> gems is only 50 dps from best in slot. Alternatively, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51918/bracers-of-dark-blessings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_47.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of Dark Blessings</span></a> accompanied by something like the hit neck <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50658/amulet-of-the-silent-eulogy">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownnecklaced.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amulet of the Silent Eulogy</span></a> to make up that cap is worse but still an acceptable early upgrade from older items. Otherwise stick with the previous phases' best in slot depending on your hit situation, but generally the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47485/bindings-of-the-ashen-saint">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_24b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bindings of the Ashen Saint</span></a> perform better than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47467/dark-essence-bindings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_32a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dark Essence Bindings</span></a> if you can get the hit elsewhere.<br/>
<br/>Before raid content you have three pretty good options, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49994/the-ladys-brittle-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_45.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Lady's Brittle Bracers</span></a> will likely be very expensive since it's a 25-Man normal mode bind on equip item, but it performs great and will allow you to itemize other slots already accounting for similar hit as the best in slot. The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47586/bejeweled-wizards-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_32a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bejeweled Wizard's Bracers</span></a> is a lot cheaper and still performs great, so stick with that if you're on a budget. Last, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47306/dark-essence-bindings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_32a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dark Essence Bindings</span></a>, if you need hit, aren't as great but they're obtainable through the new heroic gamma dungeons, otherwise you can use the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47324/bindings-of-the-ashen-saint">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_24b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bindings of the Ashen Saint</span></a>.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
