<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hands for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 4</h3>This will be the slot in which we'll run our off-piece with four-piece tier 10 surrounding it, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50722/sanlayn-ritualist-gloves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_92.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">San'layn Ritualist Gloves</span></a> is fairly uncontested and also has no hit, which is great for arcane. The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51280/sanctified-bloodmage-gloves">
