<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="waist">Waist for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 4</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50613/crushing-coldwraith-belt">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crushing Coldwraith Belt</span></a> is the best in slot with no close alternative. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50702/lingering-illness">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_68.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lingering Illness</span></a> is the closest to it, but is gapped by nearly 120 dps. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51862/cauterized-cord">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cauterized Cord</span></a> performs similarly and is a lot easier to obtain from 10-man, making it a great temporary upgrade. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51930/cord-of-the-patronizing-practitioner">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_68.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cord of the Patronizing Practitioner</span></a> is slightly worse by 20 dps when compared to the other 10-man belt, but maybe you happen to get it first - in that case feel free to use it as it's still better than last phases' best in slot options.<br/>
<br/>From last phase, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47447/belt-of-biting-cold">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_52.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of Biting Cold</span></a> is now just outclassed by <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50996/belt-of-omission">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_66.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of Omission</span></a> which is easily obtainable through <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a> after you get the four tier 10 ilvl 251 items you'll need. They can both be used if you're in dire need of hit in this slot, but as arcane with how much hit you get from the reputation ring and tier alone, I doubt you'll be in that situation. As for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47419/belt-of-the-tenebrous-mist">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_52.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Tenebrous Mist</span></a>, it's approximately 200 dps worse than the best option, you can get better from 10-man <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a>, so be sure to replace it as soon as possible.<br/>
<br/>Last for this slot, I have listed both 245 ilvl (normal mode) versions of the previously mentioned belts, which are now obtainable outside of raid through the heroic gamma dungeons.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
