<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 4</h3>This will be yet another slot where you'll just aim for tier 10. with the exception of mid-tier gearing where optionally you can plan to use the crafted <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49891/leggings-of-woven-death">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_34.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of Woven Death</span></a> item as an off-piece around other slots, while keeping the gloves at most to ilvl 264 to later replace once you get the best in slot off-piece.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
