<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 4</h2>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="neck">Neck for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 4</h3>There's three close options for the neck slot. The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50724/blood-queens-crimson-choker">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_crimsonspinel_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blood Queen's Crimson Choker</span></a> is going to be the go-to in most situations, but the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50658/amulet-of-the-silent-eulogy">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownnecklaced.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amulet of the Silent Eulogy</span></a> is very close behind assuming you can use the hit, for example if you use the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50686/death-surgeons-sleeves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_47.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death Surgeon's Sleeves</span></a> instead of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50651/the-ladys-brittle-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_44.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Lady's Brittle Bracers</span></a>. Thirdly, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50609/bone-sentinels-amulet">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_53.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bone Sentinel's Amulet</span></a> performs only 20 dps worse than the best item, so if you can get it, make sure to grab it since it's a lot less contested.<br/>
<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50182/blood-queens-crimson-choker">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_crimsonspinel_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blood Queen's Crimson Choker</span></a> is listed separately from the 277 ilvl version, because this is available outside of raid since it's a bind on equip item - this performs better past phase best in slot, so if you can afford it, you should do so until you get the best in slot. From 10-man <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a>, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51863/pendant-of-split-veins">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendant of Split Veins</span></a> is essentially identical to the previously mentioned neck, at approximately 75 dps from best in slot. There's also the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51863/pendant-of-split-veins">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendant of Split Veins</span></a> which has some hit, making it somewhat awkward to equip since arcane requires so little hit - which makes it a fair bit worse, differing 170 dps from the best neck (even assuming best in slot hit swap to not waste the stat).<br/>
<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47468/cry-of-the-valkyr">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_36.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cry of the Val'kyr</span></a> performs about 130 dps worse than the best in slot, which isn't that close, but not far either when compared to other items with similar ilvl difference, alternatively the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45133/pendant-of-fiery-havoc">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendant of Fiery Havoc</span></a> fell off in comparison, and is closer to the 200 dps loss mark. <br/>
<br/>Otherwise just get the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45243/sapphire-amulet-of-renewal">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_30naxxramas.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sapphire Amulet of Renewal</span></a> which is now obtainable using <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2711/defilers-scourgestone">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Defiler's Scourgestone</span></span></a>s from Heroic Gamma dungeons. The same applies to the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47307/cry-of-the-valkyr">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_36.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cry of the Val'kyr</span></a>, but even though it's cheaper, it performs worse.<div class="pad"></div>
