<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="rings">Rings for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 4</h3>The two best rings this phase will be the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50398/ashen-band-of-endless-destruction">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_83.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ashen Band of Endless Destruction</span></a> and the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50664/ring-of-rapid-ascent">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_86.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of Rapid Ascent</span></a>. The former will be very easy to obtain considering it's personal loot through the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a> reputation. The latter will be extremely contested. Meanwhile, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50636/memory-of-malygos">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Memory of Malygos</span></a> is only 15 dps worse than the previously mentioned ring, so it's a great option to grab a hold of early and use as alternative best in slot.<br/>
<br/>Past that, there's three other 277 ilvl rings (which I'll compare with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50664/ring-of-rapid-ascent">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_86.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of Rapid Ascent</span></a> since the other best in slot is free):<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50644/ring-of-maddening-whispers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_ahnqiraj_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of Maddening Whispers</span></a> is about 80dps worse than best in slot.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50714/valanars-other-signet-ring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_81.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valanar's Other Signet Ring</span></a> is closer to a 40 dps difference, but requires other swaps in the set, such as using <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50686/death-surgeons-sleeves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_47.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death Surgeon's Sleeves</span></a> instead of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50651/the-ladys-brittle-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_44.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Lady's Brittle Bracers</span></a>.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50714/valanars-other-signet-ring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_81.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valanar's Other Signet Ring</span></a> is quite a bit worse, being gapped by 130 dps since it's a critical strike ring instead of haste, and also requires similar swaps in other slots to fix the hit.</div></li></ul>From 10-man there's the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51849/cerise-coiled-ring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownringc.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cerise Coiled Ring</span></a> which is a great option, and it's only 80 dps from best in slot. This will be one of the best rings to aim for early to mid tier gearing. <br/>
<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47489/lurid-manifestation">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_55.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lurid Manifestation</span></a> doesn't quite fit into either of the two main categories here, but it's worth mentioning since it's last phase's best in slot and ever so slightly better than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46046/nebula-band">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_70.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nebula Band</span></a>. Though, it's gapped by 190 dps by the best rings.<br/>
<br/>Lastly, there's a few easily available pre-raid options:<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45495/conductive-seal">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_66.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conductive Seal</span></a> will now be for sale at the new Heroic Gamma Dungeon vendor for 60 <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2711/defilers-scourgestone">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Defiler's Scourgestone</span></span></a>s. This ring is about 170 dps from best in slot, making it pre-raid bis this phase.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46046/nebula-band">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_70.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nebula Band</span></a> is now easier to farm seeing as you can trade <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2711/defilers-scourgestone">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Defiler's Scourgestone</span></span></a>s for <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2589/sidereal-essence">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_icediamond_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sidereal Essence</span></span></a>, and you obtain one per boss. This ring is about 200 dps worse than the best in slot, which considering how easy it is to obtain - makes it a great early item.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47732/band-of-the-invoker">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_54.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of the Invoker</span></a> is just behind that at 230 dps from best in slot, but requires <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a>, which if your mage is freshly geared can be sparse since you'll be using them for tier 9 items.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">The 245 ilvl <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47327/lurid-manifestation">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_55.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lurid Manifestation</span></a> will now be for sale at the new Heroic Gamma Dungeon vendor for 30 <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2711/defilers-scourgestone">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Defiler's Scourgestone</span></span></a>s. Sadly it performs over 100 dps worse than both the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45495/conductive-seal">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_66.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conductive Seal</span></a> and the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46046/nebula-band">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_70.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nebula Band</span></a> making it somewhat useless.</div></li></ul>
<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
