<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 4</h3>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50348/dislodged-foreign-object">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dislodged Foreign Object</span></a> will be the new best in slot in one of the two trinket slots. Other than that, trinkets options are made easier this tier, since <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47477/reign-of-the-dead">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_crown_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reign of the Dead</span></a> is still best in slot. The 245 ilvl version of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47316/reign-of-the-dead">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_crown_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reign of the Dead</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45518/flare-of-the-heavens">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonlightwell.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flare of the Heavens</span></a> will now be obtainable through the Heroic Gamma dungeons with the <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2711/defilers-scourgestone">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Defiler's Scourgestone</span></span></a> currency. The former is third best in slot, so you should use it as the baseline.<br/>
<br/>Until you get the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50348/dislodged-foreign-object">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dislodged Foreign Object</span></a>, you should use either the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50345/muradins-spyglass">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_spyglass_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Muradin's Spyglass</span></a> from 10-man or the previously mentioned <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45518/flare-of-the-heavens">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonlightwell.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flare of the Heavens</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>Warning that although <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50365/phylactery-of-the-nameless-lich">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Phylactery of the Nameless Lich</span></a> is listed as alternative best, it's actually the real best in slot, though it requires the usage of <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=38466/sulfuron-slammer">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_summerfest_firedrink.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sulfuron Slammer</span></a>s to activate it. This makes it activate, which turns it into a faux on-use trinket to allign with your burst cooldowns for huge burst. Not many would be willing to use this weird consume/<wbr/>mechanic to activate it, so it doesn't make sense to list on the best in slot list since it would cause for misunderstandings.<div class="pad"></div>
