<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hand-weapons-for-arcane-mage-dps-phase-4">Off Hand Weapons for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 4</h4>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50719/shadow-silk-spindle">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shadow Silk Spindle</span></a> is the best in slot off-hand for basically every caster class in phase 4 meaning it will be extremely contested, luckily for arcane mages, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50635/sundial-of-eternal-dusk">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_zulaman_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sundial of Eternal Dusk</span></a> is well optimized for this specialization, meaning it's only 20 dps from best in slot, making it a great alternative to use in end-game.<br/>
<br/>Past those two, there's no real close options, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51922/scourgelords-baton">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_elfskull_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scourgelord's Baton</span></a> is near 170 dps worse, and the phase 3 off-hands are between 190 and 220 dps from the best item. Same applies for the phase 2 best in slot <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45617/cosmos">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_ulduarraid_d_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cosmos</span></a> which is now gapped by 250 dps.<br/>
<br/>The great news is for new mages, the 245 ilvl version of the 25-Man <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a> normal mode will now be available through the Heroic Gamma dungeon currency, making them great early items.<div class="pad"></div>
