<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wands-for-arcane-mage-dps-phase-4">Wands for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 4</h4>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50684/corpse-impaling-spike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_35.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Corpse-Impaling Spike</span></a> is best in slot, with the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50631/nightmare-ender">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_34.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nightmare Ender</span></a> close behind, by about 35 dps. For Alliance, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51852/wand-of-ruby-claret">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_34.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wand of Ruby Claret</span></a> is also very close, since alongside a wrist swap from <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50651/the-ladys-brittle-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_44.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Lady's Brittle Bracers</span></a> to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50686/death-surgeons-sleeves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_47.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death Surgeon's Sleeves</span></a>, it performs only 30 dps worse than the best wand.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51838/lanathels-bloody-nail">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_35.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lana'thel's Bloody Nail</span></a> is a lot worse, at 100 dps difference from the best option, it's best left to classes that benefit from critical strike chance 10-man, but if nobody else wants it, it is likely to still be an upgrade for you from the wand we've used for two phases now as best in slot - the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45294/petrified-ivy-sprig">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_29.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Petrified Ivy Sprig</span></a>, this wand is harder to use now because of it has so much hit, making it nearly 200 dps worse than the new best item.<br/>
<br/>Honorable mention to the 264 ilvl <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50472/nightmare-ender">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_34.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nightmare Ender</span></a>, which is a bind on equip item from normal mode 25-man <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a>, meaning you're likely to find it in the auction house often, if it's within your budget feel free to grab it, since it's close to 70 dps better than the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45294/petrified-ivy-sprig">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_29.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Petrified Ivy Sprig</span></a> which most of us mages are using now.<div class="pad"></div>
